{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sG62dinDz81792771765.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受薔琵影響，大灣區航空宣布調整四個航班服務。</p><p></p><p>其中原定周五晚上11時55分，前往台北的HB710航班，會延遲至周六早上6時05分出發；至於周六凌晨，由台北返港的HB711航班，亦會延遲至早上9時出發。</p><p></p><p>另外，周六由香港出發至沖繩的HB336，以及沖繩出發到香港的HB337航班，出發時間分別延遲至早上11時45分，以及下午4時20分。</p><p></p><p>大灣區航空建議乘客出發前往機場前，在公司網頁查閱最新航班狀態。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T17:24:19.338210+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T14:50:36.668382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:18:12.638181+00:00","content_hash":"4c118d75703a6ab235829cd57642706e48c3c5c3afc9b5cf1983df4ab8ef3d7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T17:24:19.338210+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}